            "review_title": "Review at Hao Yu Grilled Fish",
            "review_text": "Ngoc Nguyen\n4 contributions\n1\nLET'S TRY SICHUAN FOOD!\nApr 2019 • Friends\nIf you want to enjoy foods in a foreign eating house, specially Chinese dishes, I'll share with you my experience when I eat in HAO YU Grilled Fish- a restaurant of foods of Sichuan in Ho Chi Minh City. This restaurant makes special impression for me. \n- About space: warm felling; all of the design brings breath of Chinese style. It is the same as a road in China. We can take beautiful photographs in anywhere. \n- About food: Sichuan grilled fish with \" Huyet Trung Khanh\" sauce is one of the most loved dishes here. The fish is placed in a large pan with lots of chilli. But spicy taste is just right and perfect. It's yummy. Fish meat is very fresh. This restaurant is famous by the diversity of sauces. Therefore, the next time I come back, I will try the fish with \"Tau Xi\" sauce. Besides, Sichuan beef is soft. One of the drinks I drank is tea. It's called \"Ha Co Thao\". I think it's good for my health because it makes me cool very much. \nI think Hao Yu is very suitable for family meals, office people. You can entertain guests and partners to this eating house because the space is quiet, light but not noisy. Price is good and comfortable. Staffs are very friendly and enthusiatic . If I can assess, I will give the restaurant 5/5 point. Heartily, you should try Hao Yu Grilled Fish because it's really really delish. The Sichuan dishes are better than everyone thought. Address: 17-19 Ho Xuan Huong street, Ward 6, District 3, Ho Chi Minh City.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 19, 2019",
